# Read by ripgrep, which Claude Code's Grep/Glob and OpenCode's search use (git and the
# build ignore this file). Big generated files listed here stay out of agents' search
# results, so one grep doesn't return thousands of lines of lockfile.
# They can still be read directly, or searched with `rg --no-ignore-dot`.
pnpm-lock.yaml
apps/server/uv.lock
CHANGELOG.md
packages/ui/src/styles/themes.css
packages/ui/src/styles/themes.json
